{
  "about": "Whole-floor edit (FLOOR on the entrance's menu): the edit menu's style, prop rows and clear apply to the entrance and every passage of the floor. A style that would make the floor wider than the room changes nothing; a prop every slot already has is taken off all. A passage's own EDIT still edits only that passage. Fixture mid, floor 0 (33 slots). Moving a floor up or down is on its entrance only: passages offer NEW and EDIT.",
